# ==============================================================================
# Note that the following analysis assumes that White has played Nf3.
# The A13/14/15/16/17 complex has headache quality, we know the following facts:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# b6 e6 !Nf6					-> A13
# b6 d5 e6						-> A13 Neo-Catalan (g3 ---> "Queen's Indian Formation")
# d5 e6							-> A13
# d5 e6 !Nf6					-> A13
# e6								-> A13
# b6 d5 e6 g3 Be7 Nf6 Bg2	-> A14
# b6 !e6 !Nc3 Nf6				-> A15 "Queen's Indian Formation"
# d5 !Nc3 Nf6					-> A15 "Scandinavian Defence"
# !Nc3 Nf6						-> A15
# !e6 Nc3 Nf6					-> A16
# !e6 d5 Nc3 Nf6				-> A16
# !e6 Nc3						-> A16
# b6 e6 Nc3 Nf6				-> A17
# b6 d5 e6 Nc3 Nf6			-> A17
# e6 Nc3 Nf6					-> A17
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# But what is the right ECO code for the following combinations? We list the
# possibilities.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# d5 e6 !Nc3 Nf6				->  A13 !A14 !A15 !A16 !A17 ---> A13
# b6 d5 e6 !Nc3 Nf6			->  A13  A14 !A15 !A16 !A17 ---> A13/14
# b6 !d5 e6 !Nc3 Nf6			->  A13 !A14 !A15 !A16 !A17 ---> A13
# d5 e6 Nc3 Nf6				->  A13 !A14  A15  A16  A17 ---> A13 or A16/17
# d5 !e6 Nc3 Nf6				-> !A13 !A14  A15 !A16 !A17 ---> A15
# b6 !d5 e6 Nc3 Nf6			->  A13 !A14  A15  A16  A17 ---> A13 or A15 or A16/17
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# We deduce the following "logical" rules:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# d5 e6 g3 Be7 Nf6 Bg2		-> A14
# !Nc3							-> A13
# Nc3								-> A16/17
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Due to the fact that positions in A16/17 can be derived from positions in
# A13, but in general not from A15, we will prefer A13 over A15. So our
# assignment is:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# d5 e6 !Nc3 Nf6				-> A13
# b6 d5 e6 !Nc3 Nf6			-> A13/14
# b6 !d5 e6 !Nc3 Nf6			-> A13
# d5 e6 Nc3 Nf6				-> A16/17
# d5 !e6 Nc3 Nf6				-> A16
# b6 !d5 e6 Nc3 Nf6			-> A16/17
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Summarized these are the rules (mind the order):
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# d5 e6 g3 Nf3 Nf6 Be7 Bg2	-> A14
# e6 Nc3 Nf3 Nf6				-> A17
# Nc3 Nf3 Nf6					-> A16
# !e6 Nf3 Nf6					-> A15
# e6 Nf3							-> A13
# ==============================================================================
