# assign d4 ...b6 ...Bb7 Be7 to E17
# assign d4 Nc3 to D37
# assign d4 to E06
# assign Nc3 ...c5 to A34
# ==================================================================================
# Most web sites are assigning the Keres Defence
#     1.c4 e6 2.Nf3 d5 3.g3 Nf6 4.Bg2 Be7 5.O-O c5 6.cxd5 Nxd5 7.Nc3 Nc6
# to A14, but CB is assigning to A34. I think CB is right, because
#     1.c4 c5 2.Nc3 Nc6 3.g3 e6 4.Nf3 Nf6 5.Bg2 Be7 6.O-O d5
# belongs to A36, and the line
#     1.c4 c5 2.Nc3 Nf6 3.g3 d5
# belongs to A34, so it's logical to assign c5 Nc3 to A34.
# ==================================================================================
