# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Some are saying that position below is A09, but:
# - it's A15 due to chesstempo.com
# - it's A09 due to CB
# - it's A16 after 3.Nc3 g6 due to CB
# - after 3.e3 it's A15 due to Scid (the current position is not assigned)
# - after 3.Nc3 it's A16 due to Scid
# - after 3.Nc3 e6 it's A17.
# So it seems logical to prefer A15, othwerwise we would become the path
# A15->A09->A16/17, and this has to be avoided.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
